<%# locals: filter, sort, view, counts, username %>
<%#
  Links inside the reserved_cards frame, so Turbo swaps the list and the toggles together and the
  active state is worked out on the server.

  Three independent axes, so every toggle carries the other two's current values - dropping them
  would reset the sort every time somebody switched to "missing", which is exactly when they care
  about it least. Same rule brew/_filters and collection_sets/_filter_toggle follow.
%>

<% carry = { username: username, filter: filter, sort: sort, view: view } %>

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <% { "all" => "All", "owned" => "Owned", "missing" => "Missing" }.each do |key, label| %>
        <%= link_to collection_reserved_path(**carry.merge(filter: key)),
          class: "px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md transition cursor-pointer #{key == filter ? "bg-highlight text-nine-white" : "bg-background text-grey-text hover:bg-menu"}" do %>
          <%= label %>

          <span class="ml-1 text-xs opacity-60">
            <%= number_with_delimiter(counts[key.to_sym]) %>
          </span>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <% { "table" => "Table", "visual" => "Visual" }.each do |key, label| %>
        <%= link_to label, collection_reserved_path(**carry.merge(view: key)),
          class: "px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md transition cursor-pointer #{key == view ? "bg-highlight text-nine-white" : "bg-background text-grey-text hover:bg-menu"}" %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <% { "name" => "Name", "price" => "Price", "set" => "Set" }.each do |key, label| %>
        <%= link_to label, collection_reserved_path(**carry.merge(sort: key)),
          class: "px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-md transition cursor-pointer #{key == sort ? "bg-highlight text-nine-white" : "bg-background text-grey-text hover:bg-menu"}" %>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <%#
      The counts move when the view does, because the thing being counted moves with it. Saying which
      it is beats letting somebody wonder why Missing jumped when they clicked Visual. The figures in
      the header do not move - they are about the list, not the view.
    %>

    <p class="text-xs text-grey-text/50">
      <% if view == "visual" %>
        Counting printings - every printing is its own card here, so a Revised
        dual you do not have is missing even when you have the Beta one.
      <% else %>
        Counting cards - owned is a card you have in any printing, missing is one
        you are still short a printing of, so a card at 1 of 3 is both.
      <% end %>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
